{"type":"message","id":"d1fb0a6a","parentId":"92b99ad2","timestamp":"2026-03-29T06:05:54.265Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a complex project design question about integrating ECHO (a blockchain asset protocol with four rights separation: ownership, usage, derivation, and extension) with OpenClaw's AI Agent ecosystem. The user wants to create a project that:\n\n1. Converts \"rights\" into Agent capabilities\n2. Allows agents to interface with ECHO asset protocol\n3. Enables others to use ECHO protocol through agents\n4. Creates a paid/controlled usage ecosystem for high-value skills/knowledge bases in specialized fields\n5. Designs AI agents, on-chain systems, and other配套设施 optimized for OpenClaw\n6. Promotes the flow of high-value knowledge and experience in AI-native workflows\n7. Demonstrate through a React project\n\nLet me read the react-expert skill since this involves building a React project.","thinkingSignature":"160a7d4fc03ac36277f25956bd13e2862bfdfb5b1111156583d0837baab96bed"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":10,"output":190,"cacheRead":869,"cacheWrite":9001,"totalTokens":10070,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774764346129,"responseId":"0617f43a673e2bc96d41d4da041eafde"}}
